    "notes": [
      "BIRTH YEAR IN TENSION WITH DOCUMENTED IDENTITY (research 2026-07-03, open question): this record (b.1669, m. Hannah Drewett 1690, d. July 1693 Bucks Co., PA) matches, almost detail-for-detail, a documented Quaker minister William Stockdale who married Hannah Drewett in 1689 and died in Philadelphia in 1693 (Geni; rootsweb \"Immigration of the Irish Quakers into Pennsylvania\") — except that minister was already preaching as a \"Publisher of Truth\" in Scotland by 1655, impossible for someone born in 1669. Either this record's birth year is wrong, or two different men named William Stockdale (an elder minister and a younger immigrant) have been merged online. Unresolved without primary-source resolution."
    ]
  }
